    <briefdescription>
<para>Wave D delivery: long-duration soak test for the base module&apos;s primary hot-reload and rollback paths. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Purpose:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Validate that HotReloadManager accumulates stats monotonically over many iterations without memory leaks or counter corruption.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Demonstrate long-duration confidence in the reload/rollback/re-register cycle under controlled conditions.</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para>The iteration count is controlled by the THEMIS_SOAK_ITERATIONS environment variable (default: 1000). For CI runs this produces a fast, deterministic regression; for hardware validation the variable can be raised to 100 000+.</para>
<para>Run with: ctest -L soak <ndash/>timeout 7200 or THEMIS_SOAK_ITERATIONS=50000 ctest -L soak</para>
<para>Requires: GTest, themis_core (hot_reload_manager, module_loader). </para>
    </detaileddescription>
